    <p>Athens is less saturated than Huntsville, which works in your favor. Expect 9 to 14 months for first-page results on driveway and patio searches, sometimes faster for the rural-edge and pole-barn pad searches almost nobody is targeting. The contractors who start now own those searches before everyone else catches on.</p>

